# .NET example build output
examples/dotnet-console/bin/
examples/dotnet-console/obj/
examples/dotnet-resx/bin/
examples/dotnet-resx/obj/

# Framework / toolchain generated (see also scripts/clean-workspace.sh)
.next/
out/
